    "user_request_original": "Design a 36-layer periodic dielectric filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence at 0 degrees, unpolarized light. Stack structure: Air | (Ta2O5 (Gao) | SiO2 (Gao)) repeated 18 times | Fused Silica. Initialize layer thicknesses near quarter-wave condition at 550 nm (Ta2O5 (Gao) approximately 96 nm, SiO2 (Gao) approximately 147 nm based on typical refractive indices). Optimize all 36 individual layer thicknesses within 20-350 nm bounds to maximize average transmittance in 420-700 nm while minimizing average transmittance in 355-365 nm and 1030-1080 nm bands. Report final layer thickness sequence and transmittance spectra across 350-1100 nm.",
